{
  "component": "F17 solarize",
  "method": "手算：按 README §公式逐式笔算（m=smoothstep(thr-h,thr+h,v) → fold=mix(v,2thr-v,m) → Luma 档亮度平移保色度 / RGB 档逐通道 → amount 混合），独立一次性脚本（纯 Python，smoothstep 分支直接展开）计算，与 oracle/GLSL 无代码复用；容差 1e-6（float64 语义）。",
  "params": {
    "threshold": 1.0,
    "softness": 0.0,
    "channel_mode": "Luma",
    "amount": 1.0
  },
  "vectors": [
    {
      "input": [
        0.3,
        0.3,
        0.3
      ],
      "expected": [
        0.3,
        0.3,
        0.3
      ],
      "note": "luma=0.3<thr：不动（暗部保留）"
    },
    {
      "input": [
        2.0,
        1.0,
        0.5
      ],
      "expected": [
        1.647,
        0.647,
        0.147
      ],
      "note": "luma=1.1765>thr→fold=0.8235：整色平移 Δ=-0.353（色度向量保留）"
    },
    {
      "input": [
        4.5,
        4.5,
        4.5
      ],
      "expected": [
        -2.5,
        -2.5,
        -2.5
      ],
      "note": "超白 luma=4.5→fold=-2.5：线性折返无 clamp，HDR 折出负值（显式策略）"
    },
    {
      "input": [
        -0.25,
        -0.3,
        -0.2
      ],
      "expected": [
        -0.25,
        -0.3,
        -0.2
      ],
      "note": "负值 luma=-0.2751<thr：原样保留（符号不翻、无裁剪）"
    }
  ],
  "variant_vectors": [
    {
      "params": {
        "channel_mode": "RGB"
      },
      "input": [
        2.0,
        1.0,
        0.5
      ],
      "expected": [
        0.0,
        1.0,
        0.5
      ],
      "note": "RGB 档逐通道：2>1→0，1=thr→1（连续点），0.5<thr 不动"
    },
    {
      "params": {
        "channel_mode": "RGB"
      },
      "input": [
        12.0,
        0.1,
        4.5
      ],
      "expected": [
        -10.0,
        0.1,
        -2.5
      ],
      "note": "RGB 档 HDR：12→-10、4.5→-2.5（线性折返），0.1 不动"
    },
    {
      "params": {
        "softness": 0.5
      },
      "input": [
        0.75,
        0.75,
        0.75
      ],
      "expected": [
        0.828125,
        0.828125,
        0.828125
      ],
      "note": "软过渡 h=0.5：v=0.75 处 m=smoothstep(0.5,1.5,0.75)=0.15625，部分折返"
    },
    {
      "params": {
        "softness": 0.5
      },
      "input": [
        1.5,
        1.5,
        1.5
      ],
      "expected": [
        0.5,
